# Sheaves on a site

Generic sheaf theory on an arbitrary site: constant pullback, cohomology
pushforward, short exact sequences, and coverwise detection of local
equivalences. Sheaves of modules on a ringed site extend Mathlib's
`SheafOfModules` and live at its path, `Algebra/Category/ModuleCat/Sheaf/`.
